:"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe new AreaLight3D icon had unnecessary SVG elements in it, such as a group and a clip path.\r\n\r\nThis PR simplifies and optimizes the image, taking it from 584 bytes to 358 bytes, 38.7% smaller. The new SVG produces identical results when rendered.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used at all. I used a combination of [GodSVG](https://godsvg.com/) and [svgcleaner](https://github.com/razrfalcon/svgcleaner).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFootnote: While making this, I also considered changing the amount of rays from 8 to 12, to make it look less like the DirectionalLight3D icon. However... it just kinda looks like a circuit board. So the file included in this PR does not change the appearance at all, it just optimizes it. If anyone wants the circuit board version, here it is:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"AreaLight3D-circuitboard\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ebbfa74-aa62-404d-9c24-7fc0a0aad29f\" />\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122278/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122278/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}